MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2012.PDF","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"MSTC Limited reported its financial and operational results for the quarter and half year ended September 30, 2026, highlighting growth in standalone and consolidated revenue, EBITDA, PBT, and PAT. Management noted the completion of its exit from the legacy trading business and outlined ongoing business expansions including a TReDS platform application and travel portal upgrades. Key business achievements during the period included executing high-value e-auctions across liquor licenses, land parcels, oil rigs, coal blocks, and critical minerals. MSTC Limited reported its Q1 FY27 earnings, highlighting a nearly 22% year-on-year increase in revenue from operations to Rs. 94.25 crores, driven by the highest ever Q1 e-commerce revenue of Rs.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management aims to maintain an average double-digit growth rate over a longer period.","quote":"So, our aim is to maintain a double-digit number.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"MSTC will conduct the 15th round of commercial coal block auctions containing 17 mines.","quote":"MSTCwillconduct the15throundofCommercialCoalBlockAuctionscontaining17mines.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management expects the positive trend in the Mahindra joint venture to strengthen and continue.","quote":"And we expect this trend to strengthen and continue, driving towards a healthy financial outlook for this company.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"MSTC transacted land parcels and plots worth Rs. 2,259.52 crore for Telangana Industrial Infrastructure Corporation.","quote":"MSTChassoldland parcels/Plots etc.worthRs.2259.52crforTelangana IndustrialInfrastructure Corporation.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"MSTC is developing a TReDS platform and has applied to the RBI for requisite clearance.","quote":"MSTC is developing a TReDS platform and has applied to RBI for requisite clearance.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=83d3e06e-a4ec-43c2-ae07-d343d1662595.pdf"},{"claim":"MSTC's B2B travel portal is ready and is being upgraded for B2C operations.","quote":"MSTC Travel Portal for B2B is ready and currently being upgraded for Future B2C operation.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"},{"claim":"An ETP platform for EPR certification has been developed for CPCB and is awaiting authorization for launch.","quote":"ETP for EPR certification has been developed on behalf of CPCB and is awaiting go ahead for operation.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Standalone EBITDA reached INR 184.55 crore in 2026-27-H1 compared to INR 130.71 crore in 2025-26-H1.","quote":"EBITDA of INR 184.55 crore in 2026-27-H1 vis-\u00e0-vis INR 130.71 crore in 2025-26-H1.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=83d3e06e-a4ec-43c2-ae07-d343d1662595.pdf"},{"claim":"The EBITDA percentage of total income was 69.05%, which is nearly 3% higher than the corresponding period of FY26.","quote":"EBITDA percentage of total income was 69.05%, also nearly 3% higher than the corresponding period of FY26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Total expenses increased by 16% due to normal salary and wage increases and inflationary pressures.","quote":"So, it is generally a normal increase due to increase in the salaries and wages, normal salary wages and inflationary pressure.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Standalone EBITDA rose to INR 81.49 crore in Q1 2026-27 compared to INR 61.88 crore in Q1 2025-26.","quote":"EBITDA of INR 81.49 crore in 2026-27-Q1 vis-\u00e0-vis INR 61.88 crore in 2025-26-Q1.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"},{"claim":"Standalone Profit Before Tax stood at INR 78.53 crore for Q1 2026-27 compared to INR 59.63 crore in Q1 2025-26.","quote":"Profit Before Tax INR 78.53 crore in 2026-27-Q1 vis-\u00e0-vis INR 59.63 crore in 2025-26-Q1.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"},{"claim":"Joint venture MMRPL recorded a Q1 profit of Rs. 0.20 crore following continuous losses over four years.","quote":"JV (MMRPL) has posted Q1 profit Rs.0.20 cr after continuous loss for the last 4 years.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"MSTC allocated 4 Exploration License blocks and 10 Critical Mineral Auction blocks through its e-commerce portal.","quote":"Through MSTC e-Commerce portal, 4 EL Blocks have been successfully allocated in the 2nd tranche of Exploration License Blocks,and10blockshavebeen successfully allocated inthe7thtranche ofCriticalMineralAuctions.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"},{"claim":"MSTC signed a Selling Agency Agreement with Rashtriya Ispat Nigam Ltd to market RINL's prime products and secondary arisings.","quote":"MSTC has entered into a Selling Agency Agreement with M/s. Rashtriya Ispat Nigam Ltd for the sale of Prime ProductsandSecondary arisingsofRINL.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"},{"claim":"MSTC partnered with Kerala State Electricity Board Limited to facilitate the selection of Charge Point Operators under the PM E-DRIVE Scheme.","quote":"MSTC has partnered with Kerala State Electricity Board Limited (KSEBL) for providing e-commerce services towards the Selection of Charge Point Operators (CPOs) under the prestigious PM E-DRIVE Scheme of the GovernmentofIndia.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company has completely exited from the trading and marketing segment and recovered its dues on the 110% BG model.","quote":"We had taken a decision in FY26 to completely exit from the trading and marketing segment and have seamlessly recovered our dues on the 110% BG model, closing the chapter on this legacy segment in this quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"MSTC completed its process of exiting the legacy trading business.","quote":"MSTC hasnow completedtheplanned processof exitingthelegacy Trading business.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Scrap has always been a cyclical thing and the steel sector is very cyclical.","quote":"But scrap has always been a cyclical thing. The steel sector as such is very cyclical.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"MSTC has completed the planned process of exiting the legacy trading business.","quote":"MSTC has now completed the planned process of exiting the legacy Trading business.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=83d3e06e-a4ec-43c2-ae07-d343d1662595.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The management targets the operationalization of the TReDS platform sometime during FY27, subject to regulatory approvals.","quote":"This project is also at an advanced stage and subject to regulatory approvals being obtained, we should be able to operationalize this sometime during this FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The internal target is to hopefully obtain RBI approval and operationalize the TReDS platform within FY27.","quote":"So, our internal target is hopefully FY27, within FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The management hopes to establish the TReDS platform in the next few months.","quote":"So far the feedback that we have received from RBI is quite encouraging and we hope that we are able to establish this TReDS platform in the next few months.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_